{"thought":"DATA ARCHITECTURE — How to structure king_analysis.json:

Unlike Lehane's data (organized by technique with book examples), King's data should be organized by THE TOOLBOX metaphor — layers of craft, each with King's philosophy, principles, exercises, and application.

Structure:
{
  metadata: { Private & Confidential, sources, version },

  creative_settings: {
    temperature: 0.92,
    top_p: 0.95,
    rationale: "King's prose demands surprise, vivid imagery, unexpected connections..."
  },

  toolbox: {
    bottom_shelf: { vocabulary, grammar — the foundation },
    second_shelf: { style elements — active voice, adverb death, specific description },
    third_shelf: { scene construction — situation over plot, character revelation },
    top_shelf: { theme, symbolism — 'bones in body' metaphor }
  },

  situation_philosophy: {
    core: "Characters in predicament, watch them work free",
    vs_plotting: "I distrust plot for two reasons...",
    application_process: [...]
  },

  telepathy_engine: {
    definition: "Writing is refined telepathy",
    signal_clarity: { strong_signals: [...], noise: [...] },
    evaluation_criteria: [...]
  },

  fear_and_stakes: {
    horror_application: { how King creates dread },
    non_horror_application: { how same techniques create emotional stakes },
    ordinary_to_extraordinary: { grounding profound moments in mundane detail }
  },

  voice_craft: {
    blue_collar_authenticity: { ... },
    child_pov: { ... },
    multiple_pov: { ... },
    dialogue_principles: { ... }
  },

  pacing_mastery: {
    page_turner_technique: { ... },
    sentence_rhythm: { ... },
    chapter_architecture: { ... }
  },

  revision_engine: {
    kings_formula: "2nd draft = 1st draft - 10%",
    scalpel_integration: { ... },
    hose_integration: { ... },
    closed_door_open_door: { ... }
  },

  kings_rules: {
    hard_rules: [...],
    daily_practice: { ... },
    reading_as_craft: { ... }
  },

  application_to_walk_this_way: {
    nick_through_king_lens: { ... },
    jackie_through_king_lens: { ... },
    maxanne_through_king_lens: { ... },
    setting_through_king_lens: { ... }
  }
}","nextThoughtNeeded":true,"thoughtNumber":4,"totalThoughts":6}

